The same patch as libsignal-local.patch (Android's, for 0.105.0), for 0.106.1, which signal-cli
v0.14.10 takes (its `libsignal-version`): libsignal-net's environments are `STAGING` and
`PRODUCTION` only (`Network.java`), roots compiled in; the local override
`TESTING_ConnectionManager_newLocalOverride` is Node's only, and this lets the JNI testing library
(signal_jni_testing, built beside signal_jni) have it too, and `Network.localTestServer` call it.
Published as 0.106.1-testbox (`java/build.gradle`).

